# torchvision/timm best_checkpoint.pt files under experiments/<run>/<model>/ are 9MB-513MB each
# (ViT/VGG16 exceed GitHub's 100MB single-file limit) -- excluded here. The small YOLO nano checkpoints
# under experiments/<run>/yolo_runs/**/weights/*.pt (~5-6MB, cited as provenance evidence in the README)
# are NOT matched by this pattern and remain tracked.
backend/python/detect_penyakit/experiments/*/*/best_checkpoint.pt
